    </div>

    <p>
        <strong>Step 1 — the four landings.</strong> Press Play and count your jumps in each: on the
        floor (<em>one, then nothing</em>), off a ledge and onto the floor (<em>one again</em>), onto
        the cave mouth (<em>none — you found the trap</em>), and in mid-air over nothing
